PositionFactory::setMarketRegistry(address)
├── given caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
└── given caller is owner
    ├── when _marketRegistry is zero address
    │   └── it should revert with PositionFactoryZeroAddress
    └── when _marketRegistry is valid
        ├── it should set marketRegistry
        └── it should emit MarketRegistrySet
